# Constrained .gitignore for the PUBLIC GitHub mirror.
#
# scripts/publish-github.sh applies this as `.gitignore` and uses git-filter-repo
# to strip the paths below from the mirror's entire history. The Forgejo origin
# keeps the relaxed `.gitignore` and the full working context (Claude tooling,
# research, planning docs).

# --- Rust / build artifacts ---
/target
**/*.rs.bk
extension/schemas/gschemas.compiled

# --- Editor / OS ---
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Local scratch / run artifacts ---
/scratch/
.tribunal/

# === Excluded from the public mirror ===

# Claude Code instrumentation
.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json
/memory/

# Design / planning / research (internal prep)
RESEARCH-BRIEF.md
research/
docs/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
docs/gnome48-audit.md
docs/known-loss.md
docs/private-interface.md
docs/README.md

